adjudication.rationale:
Diff adds `addMembers` action in `admin-group.js.es6`:
```js
addMembers: function() {
  // TODO: should clear the input
  if (Em.isEmpty(this.get("usernames"))) { return; }
  this.get("model").addMembers(this.get("usernames"));
}
```
There is no code to clear `this.usernames` after the add completes, and the inline TODO explicitly acknowledges this. This is a real, diff-grounded UX/workflow issue (can lead to accidental repeat submission), but it’s not a correctness defect since adding members still functions as intended and re-submission is user-driven.
